+++    subgraph "Tactical Orchestration"
+++        F["Triad Council / Epistemic Doubt (PERSISTENT LOOP: Max-Iterations Cap)"]
+++        G["Shadow Net: Ring-0 eBPF (Deterministic Fallback)"]
+++        I["Aegis Containment (OS-Level SIGSTOP)"]
+++    end
+++
+++    %% Forensic Audit
